 department apply for a free grill?","text":"<p>Fill out the online application form, submit the required documents, and wait for approval.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_KfiWRj":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What are Official Service ID Card and Organization Application Letter?","text":"<p>Official Service ID Card is an identification card that represents your organization's identity. The Organization Application Letter should explain the reason for applying for the grill, its intended use, and must include a signature and official stamp.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_7GdbLx":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Is there a deadline to apply?","text":"<p>Applications are accepted on an ongoing basis, but availability is limited.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_8R8F6K":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How many grills can an organization request?","text":"<p>Each approved organization is eligible for one free grill.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_WM9mtE":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can we apply again if we already received a grill?","text":"<p>At this time, each organization is eligible for only one grill.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_FW6gRG":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How will I know if my application is approved?","text":"<p>You will receive a confirmation email once your application is reviewed and approved.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"category_HEBiNT":{"type":"category","settings":{"text":"Processing & Shipment","text_id":""}},"question_6ibEFw":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How long does it take to process the application?","text":"<p>Applications are reviewed within <strong>1-3 business days<\/strong>.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_NyMKbz":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How soon will the grill be shipped after approval?","text":"<p>Once approved, we will arrange shipment within <strong>24 hours.<\/strong><\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_dxGGzj":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Do we need to pay for shipping?","text":"<p>No, shipping is fully covered by Monument Grills.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_8H8YBD":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Which shipping carriers do you use?","text":"<p>We use reputable carriers such as UPS, FedEx, or freight services depending on location.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_bPTdY3":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can we choose which grill model we receive?","text":"<p>You may select from available models listed on the application form.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_xDFapx":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can we track our shipment?","text":"<p>Yes, a tracking number will be provided once your grill is shipped.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"category_4NnmJT":{"type":"category","settings":{"text":"Usage & Support","text_id":""}},"question_e9fRWh":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Is assembly required?","text":"<p>Yes, basic assembly is required, and instructions will be provided.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_EUEAFU":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Does the grill come with a warranty?","text":"<p>Yes, all grills come with a standard <strong>manufacturer's warranty<\/strong>.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_BqFxVn":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Can we get additional accessories for our grill?","text":"<p>Accessories are not included, but they can be purchased separately.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_MrGWkw":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Who can we contact if we have questions?","text":"<p>You can reach our support team at customerservice@monumentgrills.com.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_6QrUG8":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How can we share our experience after receiving t